{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# Microsoft Defender for Cloud - Regulatory Compliance"
      },
      "name": "headertext"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "value::selected"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "b859a03f-2283-43dd-8536-42714bbfced6",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Subscription",
            "type": 6,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "resourcecontainers\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.resources/subscriptions'\r\n| project value = id, label = name\r\n| order by label asc",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "value::selected"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all",
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "4bb21693-252d-4124-ad62-f37c0f6582b4",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Control",
            "label": "Compliance standard",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "isGlobal": true,
            "query": "securityresources\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.security/regulatorycompliancestandards'\r\n| project value = name, label = name\r\n| distinct value, label\r\n| order by label asc",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{Subscription}"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all",
            "value": "value::all",
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
          },
          {
            "id": "1552df0b-285f-4de5-9d99-bae04069ef1e",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "selectedTab",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "isGlobal": true,
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "value": "Overview"
          },
          {
            "id": "a8f3b011-c3aa-4ca5-aab5-77068eb42cc0",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailScope",
            "label": "Compliance Detail scope",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "isGlobal": true,
            "query": "securityresources\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.security/regulatorycompliancestandards'\r\n| where isnotempty(subscriptionId) and isnotempty(name)\r\n| distinct subscriptionId, name\r\n| join kind=leftouter (resourcecontainers | where type =~ 'microsoft.resources/subscriptions' | project subscriptionId, SubscriptionName = name) on subscriptionId\r\n| project value = tostring(pack('subscriptionId', subscriptionId, 'name', name)), label = strcat(coalesce(SubscriptionName, subscriptionId), ' - ', name, ' (', subscriptionId, ')')\r\n| order by label asc",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{Subscription}"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "{}",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all",
            "value": "value::all",
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2f061d1-08af-42bb-9aea-35cb6450fa3d",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "WorkloadResourceScope",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "isGlobal": true,
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "value": "{}"
          },
          {
            "id": "60c32a58-f5f4-4a56-92da-ef2e33d44a8d",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SelectedControlScope",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "isGlobal": true,
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "value": "{}"
          },
          {
            "id": "ee0a06d1-ce65-4343-b21b-d4d2e0d0eeb7",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "OverviewOutcome",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "isGlobal": true,
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "value": "All"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
      },
      "name": "top-params"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "Explore Microsoft Defender for Cloud regulatory compliance by subscription, workload, and control. The subscription filter scopes all views. The compliance-standard filter applies to Overview, Workloads, and Compliance Detail; the separate Compliance Detail scope selects one subscription and standard for that tab only. History has its own standard selector, while export and delivery checks examine all standards. Current posture and observed history are not certification evidence."
      },
      "name": "abouttext"
    },
    {
      "type": 11,
      "content": {
        "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
        "style": "tabs",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": "00bbb3ff-809c-4c98-baaf-4535f45f6213",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Overview",
            "subTarget": "Overview",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "abe14384-8870-4bfc-aae7-b16ac3fd33ee",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Workloads",
            "subTarget": "Workloads",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "ef9da66d-adb9-45c1-b6ec-45e4872eb2ef",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Compliance Detail",
            "subTarget": "Detail",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "caa26946-e406-4efb-81fc-18c84af3d51c",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Regulatory Compliance Configuration",
            "subTarget": "Readiness",
            "style": "link"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "links - 3"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resourcecontainers\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.resources/subscriptions'\r\n| project subscriptionId\r\n| join kind=leftouter (\r\n    securityresources\r\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.security/regulatorycompliancestandards'\r\n    | where \"{Control:escapejson}\" == '*' or name == \"{Control:escapejson}\"\r\n    | summarize ReportingStandards = count(), AssessedStandards = countif(toint(properties.passedControls) + toint(properties.failedControls) > 0), FailingStandards = countif(toint(properties.failedControls) > 0) by subscriptionId\r\n) on subscriptionId\r\n| summarize SelectedSubscriptions = count(), ReportingSubscriptions = countif(ReportingStandards > 0), AssessedStandards = sum(AssessedStandards), FailingStandards = sum(FailingStandards)\r\n| project Tiles = pack_array(pack('Title', 'Subscriptions reporting', 'Value', ReportingSubscriptions, 'Context', strcat('of ', SelectedSubscriptions, ' selected subscriptions')), pack('Title', 'Standards assessed', 'Value', AssessedStandards, 'Context', 'Subscription-standard pairs with assessed controls'), pack('Title', 'Standards with failures', 'Value', FailingStandards, 'Context', 'Subscription-standard pairs with failed controls'))\r\n| mv-expand Tile = Tiles limit 3\r\n| project Title = tostring(Tile.Title), Value = tolong(Tile.Value), Context = tostring(Tile.Context)",
              "size": 3,
              "title": "Compliance coverage",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Title",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Context",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "size": "auto"
              },
              "noDataMessage": "No subscription metadata is available in the selected scope. Check subscription selection and Reader permissions.",
              "noDataMessageStyle": 2
            },
            "name": "ComplianceCoverage"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Control outcomes\nThe chart sums the four standard-reported control counts for subscription-standard results in scope. It excludes rows with missing or negative counts. The same control can occur in multiple subscriptions or standards, so these are **not unique controls or a compliance score**. Other control states are available in Compliance Detail.\n\n**Active table outcome filter: {OverviewOutcome}.** Select Failed, Passed, Skipped or Unsupported to show subscription-standard rows with a positive count for that outcome and complete, nonnegative counts for all four outcomes. All also retains incomplete rows; the chart and coverage cards keep their full current scope.\n\n**Keyboard and clearing:** focus a chart legend item and press **Enter** to select or deselect it; selecting it again returns the table to All. Space may not activate the legend. **Clear outcome filter** below also returns the table to All, including when the chart has no results. A legend highlight can remain after this parameter-only clear: deselect that legend item before selecting it again. The active filter text above is the table's current state."
            },
            "name": "OverviewControlOutcomesGuidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "securityresources\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.security/regulatorycompliancestandards'\r\n| where \"{Control:escapejson}\" == '*' or name == \"{Control:escapejson}\"\r\n| extend Passed = tolong(properties.passedControls), Failed = tolong(properties.failedControls), Skipped = tolong(properties.skippedControls), Unsupported = tolong(properties.unsupportedControls)\r\n| where isnotnull(Passed) and isnotnull(Failed) and isnotnull(Skipped) and isnotnull(Unsupported) and Passed >= 0 and Failed >= 0 and Skipped >= 0 and Unsupported >= 0\r\n| summarize CompleteRows = count(), Passed = sum(Passed), Failed = sum(Failed), Skipped = sum(Skipped), Unsupported = sum(Unsupported)\r\n| where CompleteRows > 0\r\n| project Outcomes = pack_array(pack('State', 'Failed', 'Results', Failed), pack('State', 'Passed', 'Results', Passed), pack('State', 'Skipped', 'Results', Skipped), pack('State', 'Unsupported', 'Results', Unsupported))\r\n| mv-expand Outcome = Outcomes limit 4\r\n| project State = tostring(Outcome.State), Results = tolong(Outcome.Results)",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Control outcomes across selected standards",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "barchart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "seriesLabelSettings": [
                  {
                    "seriesName": "Failed",
                    "color": "red"
                  },
                  {
                    "seriesName": "Passed",
                    "color": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "seriesName": "Skipped",
                    "color": "yellow"
                  },
                  {
                    "seriesName": "Unsupported",
                    "color": "gray"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "noDataMessage": "No standards with complete nonnegative control counts were returned. Check the filters and read access, and review the table below.",
              "noDataMessageStyle": 2,
              "exportedParameters": [
                {
                  "fieldName": "label",
                  "parameterName": "OverviewOutcome",
                  "parameterType": 1,
                  "defaultValue": "All"
                }
              ]
            },
            "name": "OverviewControlOutcomes"
          },
          {
            "type": 11,
            "name": "ClearOverviewOutcome",
            "content": {
              "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
              "style": "toolbar",
              "links": [
                {
                  "id": "09738941-3f76-42fa-98ed-60cf4a915560",
                  "cellValue": "OverviewOutcome",
                  "linkTarget": "parameter",
                  "linkLabel": "Clear outcome filter (show all)",
                  "subTarget": "All",
                  "style": "link"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Compliance by subscription\nExpand a subscription to compare its standards. To inspect controls, choose its subscription and standard in **Compliance Detail scope** above, then choose **Open selected standard in Compliance Detail** below the table. The current detail scope is shown there and can be cleared; expanding a subscription does not open the detail tab. The scope picker can show at most 1,000 subscription-standard options; narrow **Subscription** if a choice is missing. Subscriptions with failing standards appear first. Subscription status is the worst child result; a standard with no assessed controls or incomplete counts is not marked passed.\n\nCounts and pass percentages are **per standard**. Pass % = passed / (passed + failed); skipped and unsupported controls are excluded. No assessed controls is **N/A**. Overlapping standards are not combined into a subscription compliance percentage."
            },
            "name": "OverviewGuidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "securityresources\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.security/regulatorycompliancestandards'\r\n| where \"{Control:escapejson}\" == '*' or name == \"{Control:escapejson}\"\r\n| extend Passed = tolong(properties.passedControls), Failed = tolong(properties.failedControls), Skipped = tolong(properties.skippedControls), Unsupported = tolong(properties.unsupportedControls), StandardState = tostring(properties.state)\r\n| where \"{OverviewOutcome:escapejson}\" == 'All' or (isnotnull(Passed) and isnotnull(Failed) and isnotnull(Skipped) and isnotnull(Unsupported) and Passed >= 0 and Failed >= 0 and Skipped >= 0 and Unsupported >= 0 and ((\"{OverviewOutcome:escapejson}\" == 'Failed' and Failed > 0) or (\"{OverviewOutcome:escapejson}\" == 'Passed' and Passed > 0) or (\"{OverviewOutcome:escapejson}\" == 'Skipped' and Skipped > 0) or (\"{OverviewOutcome:escapejson}\" == 'Unsupported' and Unsupported > 0)))\r\n| extend Assessed = Passed + Failed\r\n| extend PassPercent = iff(Assessed > 0 and Passed >= 0 and Failed >= 0, round(100.0 * Passed / Assessed, 1), real(null)), Status = case(Failed > 0 or StandardState =~ 'Failed', 2, isnull(Passed) or isnull(Failed) or isnull(Skipped) or isnull(Unsupported) or Passed < 0 or Failed < 0 or Skipped < 0 or Unsupported < 0 or Assessed == 0 or StandardState !~ 'Passed', 1, 0)\r\n| join kind=leftouter (\r\n    securityresources\r\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.security/regulatorycompliancestandards'\r\n    | where \"{Control:escapejson}\" == '*' or name == \"{Control:escapejson}\"\r\n    | summarize SubscriptionFailingStandards = countif(tolong(properties.failedControls) > 0), SubscriptionFailedResults = sum(tolong(properties.failedControls)) by subscriptionId\r\n) on subscriptionId\r\n| project subscriptionId, name, Status, Failed, Passed, Skipped, Unsupported, PassPercent, SubscriptionFailingStandards, SubscriptionFailedResults\r\n| order by SubscriptionFailingStandards desc, SubscriptionFailedResults desc, subscriptionId asc, Failed desc, name asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Subscription and standard results",
              "noDataMessage": "No subscription-standard results match the current subscription, standard and outcome filters. Clear the outcome filter or check read permissions and enabled Microsoft Defender for Cloud compliance initiatives.",
              "noDataMessageStyle": 2,
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "exportToExcelOptions": "all",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "$gen_group",
                    "formatter": 15,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "showIcon": true,
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "32ch"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "name",
                    "formatter": 1,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "48ch",
                      "aggregation": "None"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Status",
                    "formatter": 18,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "aggregation": "Max",
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "24ch",
                      "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                      "thresholdsGrid": [
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "2",
                          "representation": "3",
                          "text": "Failed"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "1",
                          "representation": "Unavailable",
                          "text": "Not assessed / unknown"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "0",
                          "representation": "success",
                          "text": "Passed"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "Default",
                          "representation": "Blank",
                          "text": ""
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Passed",
                    "formatter": 3,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "green",
                      "aggregation": "None"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Failed",
                    "formatter": 3,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red",
                      "aggregation": "None"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "^(Skipped|Unsupported)$",
                    "formatter": 1,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "aggregation": "None"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "PassPercent",
                    "formatter": 3,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "green",
                      "min": 0,
                      "max": 100,
                      "aggregation": "None",
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "26ch"
                    },
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "options": {
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 1
                      },
                      "emptyValCustomText": "N/A"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "^(SubscriptionFailingStandards|SubscriptionFailedResults)$",
                    "formatter": 5,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "aggregation": "Max"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "subscriptionId",
                    "formatter": 5,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "aggregation": "None"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "filter": true,
                "hierarchySettings": {
                  "treeType": 1,
                  "groupBy": [
                    "subscriptionId"
                  ],
                  "expandTopLevel": false
                },
                "sortBy": [
                  {
                    "itemKey": "SubscriptionFailingStandards",
                    "sortOrder": 2
                  },
                  {
                    "itemKey": "SubscriptionFailedResults",
                    "sortOrder": 2
                  },
                  {
                    "itemKey": "Failed",
                    "sortOrder": 2
                  }
                ],
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "subscriptionId",
                    "label": "Subscription"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "name",
                    "label": "Compliance Standard"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Status",
                    "label": "Status"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Failed",
                    "label": "Failed"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Passed",
                    "label": "Passed"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Skipped",
                    "label": "Skipped"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Unsupported",
                    "label": "Unsupported"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "PassPercent",
                    "label": "Pass % (assessed controls)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "name": "regulatorycompliancesummary"
          },
          {
            "type": 12,
            "name": "OverviewSelectedDetail",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "DetailScope",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
              "value": "{}"
            },
            "content": {
              "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
              "groupType": "editable",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": 1,
                  "name": "OverviewSelectedDetailLabel",
                  "content": {
                    "json": "**Current detail scope:** {DetailScope:$.name}  \n**Subscription ID:** {DetailScope:$.subscriptionId}"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": 11,
                  "name": "OverviewSelectedDetailActions",
                  "content": {
                    "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
                    "style": "toolbar",
                    "links": [
                      {
                        "id": "37de38e5-2565-4db4-bf37-54fda003be86",
                        "cellValue": "selectedTab",
                        "linkTarget": "parameter",
                        "linkLabel": "Open selected standard in Compliance Detail",
                        "subTarget": "Detail",
                        "style": "link"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "c1b19d2a-3164-4715-aacd-77f423bf3b34",
                        "cellValue": "DetailScope",
                        "linkTarget": "parameter",
                        "linkLabel": "Clear selected standard",
                        "subTarget": "{}",
                        "style": "link"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Overview"
      },
      "name": "RegulatoryComplianceOverview"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "8eb54e18-cdb6-48b3-a917-9cd07fd5f3af",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "Workload",
                  "label": "Workload",
                  "type": 2,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ],
                  "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"Compute\",\"label\":\"Compute\"},{\"value\":\"Containers\",\"label\":\"Containers\"},{\"value\":\"Databases\",\"label\":\"Databases\"},{\"value\":\"Storage\",\"label\":\"Storage\"},{\"value\":\"Key Vault\",\"label\":\"Key Vault\"},{\"value\":\"Networking\",\"label\":\"Networking\"},{\"value\":\"App Services\",\"label\":\"App Services\"},{\"value\":\"Subscription-level\",\"label\":\"Subscription-level\"},{\"value\":\"Other/unmapped\",\"label\":\"Other/unmapped\"}]",
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "defaultValue": "value::all",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "selectAllValue": "*",
                    "showDefault": false
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "275b4df5-b74a-4a56-b11f-0c1a85575b95",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "WorkloadState",
                  "label": "Resource detail state",
                  "type": 2,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ],
                  "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"Unhealthy\",\"label\":\"Unhealthy\"},{\"value\":\"Healthy\",\"label\":\"Healthy\"},{\"value\":\"NotApplicable\",\"label\":\"Not applicable\"},{\"value\":\"Unknown\",\"label\":\"Unknown\"},{\"value\":\"Unmapped\",\"label\":\"No resource assessment\"}]",
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "defaultValue": "value::all",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "selectAllValue": "*",
                    "showDefault": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "style": "pills"
            },
            "name": "WorkloadFilters"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Resource posture by workload\nWorkloads are classified by **provider-qualified resource type**, not by application name or business tags. Compliance recommendations are matched to resource assessments within each subscription, then deduplicated by resource identity and assessment key so mappings to multiple controls/standards do not inflate counts.\n\nThe summary uses **all assessment states** in the selected subscription, standard, and workload scope; the **Resource detail state** checkboxes affect **resource detail only** and default to **All**. Assessed resources have at least one Healthy or Unhealthy assessment. A resource with any Unhealthy assessment is counted once under resources with failures. Not applicable and Unknown results are separate, not healthy. High-severity findings are Unhealthy assessments only.\n\nRecommendations without a resource assessment, and findings without an identifiable resource, remain visible in **Other/unmapped** but are excluded from resource totals. Non-Azure resources without a recognized provider-qualified type also remain in Other/unmapped. This is resource posture, **not a regulatory compliance percentage**."
            },
            "name": "WorkloadGuidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "securityresources\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.security/regulatorycompliancestandards/regulatorycompliancecontrols/regulatorycomplianceassessments'\r\n| extend ComplianceStandard = extract('(?i)/regulatorycompliancestandards/([^/]+)/', 1, id)\r\n| where \"{Control:escapejson}\" == '*' or ComplianceStandard == \"{Control:escapejson}\"\r\n| project subscriptionId, AssessmentKey = name, MappedRecommendation = tostring(properties.description), MappedLink = tostring(properties.assessmentDetailsLink)\r\n| summarize MappedRecommendation = any(MappedRecommendation), MappedLink = any(MappedLink) by subscriptionId, AssessmentKey\r\n| join kind=leftouter (\r\n    securityresources\r\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.security/assessments'\r\n    | extend Source = tolower(tostring(properties.resourceDetails.Source))\r\n    | project subscriptionId, AssessmentKey = name, AssessmentId = id, Source, NativeResourceId = case(Source in ('aws', 'gcp') and isnotempty(tostring(properties.resourceDetails.ConnectorId)) and isnotempty(tostring(properties.resourceDetails.Id)), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.Id), Source == 'aws', tostring(properties.resourceDetails.AwsResourceId), Source == 'gcp', tostring(properties.resourceDetails.GcpResourceId), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.Id)), NativeResourceType = tostring(properties.resourceDetails.ResourceType), AssessmentResourceGroup = resourceGroup, AssessmentRecommendation = tostring(properties.displayName), StatusCode = tostring(properties.status.code), AssessmentSeverity = tostring(properties.metadata.severity), AssessmentLink = tostring(properties.links.azurePortal)\r\n) on subscriptionId, AssessmentKey\r\n| extend ResourceId = case(isnotempty(NativeResourceId), NativeResourceId, isempty(Source) or Source == 'azure', extract('(?i)^(.+)/providers/microsoft.security/assessments/[^/]+$', 1, AssessmentId), '')\r\n| extend ResourceSource = case(isempty(AssessmentId), 'unmapped', isnotempty(Source), Source, ResourceId startswith '/subscriptions/', 'azure', 'unknown'), NormalizedId = tolower(ResourceId)\r\n| extend ProviderPath = tostring(split(NormalizedId, '/providers/')[-1])\r\n| extend ResourceType = case(NormalizedId startswith '/subscriptions/' and ProviderPath != NormalizedId, strcat(tostring(split(ProviderPath, '/')[0]), '/', strcat_array(extract_all(@'/([^/]+)/[^/]+', ProviderPath), '/')), NormalizedId matches regex '^/subscriptions/[^/]+$', 'microsoft.resources/subscriptions', isnotempty(NativeResourceType), NativeResourceType, 'Unmapped')\r\n| extend ResourceGroup = iff(ResourceSource == 'azure', extract('(?i)/resourcegroups/([^/]+)', 1, ResourceId), AssessmentResourceGroup), ResourceKey = case(isempty(AssessmentId), 'No resource assessment', isempty(ResourceId), strcat('Resource identity unavailable: ', AssessmentId), ResourceSource == 'azure', NormalizedId, strcat(ResourceSource, ':', ResourceId))\r\n| extend Workload = case(isempty(ResourceId), 'Other/unmapped', ResourceType =~ 'microsoft.resources/subscriptions', 'Subscription-level', ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.compute/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.hybridcompute/', 'Compute', ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.containerservice/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.containerregistry/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.kubernetes/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.app/containerapps' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.app/managedenvironments', 'Containers', ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.sql/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.sqlvirtualmachine/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.dbforpostgresql/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.dbformysql/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.dbformariadb/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.documentdb/' or ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.cache/', 'Databases', ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.storage/', 'Storage', ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.keyvault/', 'Key Vault', ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.network/', 'Networking', ResourceType startswith 'microsoft.web/', 'App Services', 'Other/unmapped')\r\n| extend State = case(isempty(AssessmentId), 'Unmapped', StatusCode =~ 'Unhealthy', 'Unhealthy', StatusCode =~ 'Healthy', 'Healthy', StatusCode =~ 'NotApplicable', 'NotApplicable', 'Unknown'), Severity = case(AssessmentSeverity =~ 'High', 'High', AssessmentSeverity =~ 'Medium', 'Medium', AssessmentSeverity =~ 'Low', 'Low', 'Unknown'), Recommendation = coalesce(AssessmentRecommendation, MappedRecommendation, AssessmentKey), RecommendationLink = case(AssessmentLink matches regex '(?i)^https://portal[.]azure[.](com|us|cn)([/?#]|$)', AssessmentLink, AssessmentLink matches regex '(?i)^portal[.]azure[.](com|us|cn)([/?#]|$)', strcat('https://', AssessmentLink), MappedLink matches regex '(?i)^https://portal[.]azure[.](com|us|cn)([/?#]|$)', MappedLink, MappedLink matches regex '(?i)^portal[.]azure[.](com|us|cn)([/?#]|$)', strcat('https://', MappedLink), ''), ResourceDisplay = case(isempty(AssessmentId), 'No resource assessment', isempty(ResourceId), 'Resource identity unavailable', ResourceId)\r\n| extend StatusRank = case(State == 'Unhealthy', 4, State == 'Unknown', 3, State == 'Unmapped', 2, State == 'NotApplicable', 1, 0), SeverityRank = case(Severity == 'High', 3, Severity == 'Medium', 2, Severity == 'Low', 1, 0)\r\n| extend RowRank = StatusRank * 10 + SeverityRank\r\n| project Workload, subscriptionId, ResourceKey, AssessmentKey, ResourceId, ResourceDisplay, ResourceType, ResourceGroup, ResourceSource, Recommendation, State, Severity, RecommendationLink, AssessmentId, StatusRank, SeverityRank, RowRank\r\n| summarize arg_max(RowRank, *) by subscriptionId, ResourceKey, AssessmentKey\r\n| where '*' in ({Workload}) or Workload in ({Workload})\r\n| summarize AssessedPairs = countif(State in ('Healthy', 'Unhealthy')), FailedPairs = countif(State == 'Unhealthy'), HighPairs = countif(State == 'Unhealthy' and Severity == 'High'), NotApplicablePairs = countif(State == 'NotApplicable'), UnknownPairs = countif(State == 'Unknown'), UnmappedPairs = countif(State == 'Unmapped'), HasIdentity = max(iff(isnotempty(ResourceId), 1, 0)) by Workload, subscriptionId, ResourceKey\r\n| summarize AssessedResources = countif(HasIdentity == 1 and AssessedPairs > 0), ResourcesWithFailures = countif(HasIdentity == 1 and FailedPairs > 0), FailedFindings = sum(FailedPairs), HighSeverityFindings = sum(HighPairs), NotApplicableFindings = sum(NotApplicablePairs), UnknownFindings = sum(UnknownPairs), UnmappedRecommendations = sum(UnmappedPairs) by Workload\r\n| order by ResourcesWithFailures desc, HighSeverityFindings desc, FailedFindings desc, Workload asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Workload summary - all assessment states",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "exportToExcelOptions": "all",
              "noDataMessage": "No compliance recommendations matched the selected subscriptions, standard, and workload. Check filters, permissions, and enabled compliance initiatives.",
              "noDataMessageStyle": 2,
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Workload",
                    "formatter": 1,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "22ch"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "^(ResourcesWithFailures|FailedFindings|HighSeverityFindings)$",
                    "formatter": 3,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "AssessedResources",
                    "label": "Assessed resources"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "ResourcesWithFailures",
                    "label": "Resources with failures"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "FailedFindings",
                    "label": "Failed findings"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "HighSeverityFindings",
                    "label": "High-severity failures"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "NotApplicableFindings",
                    "label": "Not applicable"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "UnknownFindings",
                    "label": "Unknown state"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "UnmappedRecommendations",
                    "label": "Unmapped recommendations"
                  }
                ],
                "filter": true,
                "sortBy": [
                  {
                    "itemKey": "ResourcesWithFailures",
                    "sortOrder": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "name": "WorkloadSummary"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Resource findings - resource-first drill-down\nSelect **one Detail subscription** below, then select an individual resource row to load its recommendations. No subscription is selected by default, so this view does not request the entire resource-recommendation inventory at once. The workload summary above remains across the main selected subscriptions and all assessment states.\n\n**Resource contains** filters resource ID, resource group and provider-qualified type **in the query**, before results are returned. Workload and Resource detail state also restrict this browser; the main Compliance standard filter still applies. These detail-only filters do not change the workload summary.\n\nThe scope table counts matching resources/identity groups and findings before output limits. Both detail grids use the [Workbooks maximum of 10,000 rows](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/visualize/workbooks-limits). If the resource budget is exceeded, narrow Workload or Resource contains; if a selected resource exceeds the recommendation budget, narrow standard or state. Counts and lists refresh in separate requests and can change between them. Source visibility and service limits still apply.\n\nGrid search filters returned data only; **Excel exports are scoped to that table's returned rows**, not an unlimited tenant inventory. Missing identities and unmapped recommendations remain selectable groups rather than being dropped. Use **Hide resource details** below to stop showing recommendations; an empty filtered result is not proof of compliance.\n\nDetail requests are scoped to the one Detail subscription. The browser stays hidden when that selection is empty or outside the main Subscription filter, and both sides of each detail join reapply the main subscription scope. Choose a Detail subscription within the current main scope. These guards do **not** guarantee complete Resource Graph results or exports, or prove that every parameter-update race is prevented. Review native partial-query warnings; affected results and exports may be incomplete or incorrect.\n\n**Reselecting a resource:** Hide resource details clears the exported detail scope, **not the grid's selected row**. To reopen the same resource, deselect its row checkbox, then select it again. Keyboard users should focus the row checkbox and use its native toggle interaction. Refreshing the grid or clearing Detail subscription is not a selection-reset workaround."
            },
            "name": "WorkloadDetailGuidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "name": "WorkloadResourceFilters",
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "style": "pills",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "5065562e-088b-4de8-907d-c37c353d6fc6",
