                      {
                        "type": 1,
                        "name": "WorkloadSelectedResourceGuidance",
                        "content": {
                          "json": "### Recommendations for selected resource\nSelect an individual resource row above. Recommendations are queried only for that subscription and resource identity, within the current standard, workload, state and resource-search filters. Workload or subscription group rows never open an unscoped findings query.\n\nSelect a resource row outside its link to load recommendations. An Azure resource name opens its resource overview; a recommendation link opens its reported Defender destination. Native-cloud or unresolved identities remain text, not Azure links. Some recommendation links open the general recommendation when no resource-specific destination is available."
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": 11,
