          {
            "type": 1,
            "name": "ReadinessCspmFeaturesGuidance",
            "content": {
              "json": "#### CSPM feature switches and review findings\n**Enabled / Disabled** comes only from the reported extension switch, separately from its paid parent plan. **Not reported** is not Disabled. Expected components remain visible even without a switch; unknown/new extensions remain visible for review.\n\nThis subscription-only audit does not establish effective resource coverage, inherited or connector settings, completed scans or protection supplied by another plan. The grid shows reported **VM exclusion tags** and additional-property **names**, not arbitrary property values or secrets. **Not reported** is not proof that no exclusions exist. Missing/invalid arrays, duplicate or unrecognized switches, and settings arrays exceeding the 2,000-entry expansion budget are review findings. Narrow the subscription selection if a result-limit warning appears; grid search and export cannot retrieve omitted rows. Use cell details for the full review guidance."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "name": "ReadinessCspmFeatures",
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resourcecontainers\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.resources/subscriptions'\r\n| project subscriptionId = tolower(subscriptionId), Subscription = name, SubscriptionResourceId = id\r\n| join kind=leftouter (\r\n    securityresources\r\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.security/pricings' and name =~ 'CloudPosture'\r\n    | where id =~ strcat('/subscriptions/', subscriptionId, '/providers/Microsoft.Security/pricings/', name)\r\n    | project subscriptionId = tolower(subscriptionId), PlanId = id, PricingTier = tostring(properties.pricingTier), Extensions = properties.extensions\r\n) on subscriptionId\r\n| extend ExtensionCount = array_length(Extensions)\r\n| extend ExpectedSettings = dynamic([{\"name\":\"AgentlessVmScanning\"},{\"name\":\"AgentlessDiscoveryForKubernetes\"},{\"name\":\"ContainerRegistriesVulnerabilityAssessments\"},{\"name\":\"SensitiveDataDiscovery\"},{\"name\":\"EntraPermissionsManagement\"},{\"name\":\"ApiPosture\"},{\"name\":\"AgentlessServerlessPosture\"},{\"name\":\"ServerlessContainers\"}])\r\n| extend Settings = array_concat(ExpectedSettings, iff(isnotnull(ExtensionCount), Extensions, dynamic([])))\r\n| mv-expand with_itemindex=SettingIndex Setting = Settings limit 2000\r\n| extend SettingId = tolower(tostring(Setting.name)), IsReported = SettingIndex >= 8, RawState = tostring(Setting.isEnabled)\r\n| extend InventoryComplete = isnotnull(ExtensionCount) and ExtensionCount <= 1992\r\n| summarize ReportedRows = countif(IsReported), EnabledRows = countif(IsReported and RawState =~ 'True'), DisabledRows = countif(IsReported and RawState =~ 'False'), UnknownRows = countif(IsReported and RawState !in~ ('True', 'False')), ExclusionValues = make_set(Setting.additionalExtensionProperties.ExclusionTags), PropertyNames = make_set(bag_keys(Setting.additionalExtensionProperties)), ReportedNames = make_set(Setting.name)\r\n    by subscriptionId, Subscription, SubscriptionResourceId, PlanId, PricingTier, SettingId, InventoryComplete\r\n| extend Feature = case(SettingId == 'agentlessvmscanning', 'Agentless scanning for machines', SettingId == 'agentlessdiscoveryforkubernetes', 'Kubernetes API access / agentless discovery', SettingId == 'containerregistriesvulnerabilityassessments', 'Registry access / image vulnerability assessment', SettingId == 'sensitivedatadiscovery', 'Sensitive data discovery', SettingId == 'entrapermissionsmanagement', 'Identity and permissions (CIEM)', SettingId == 'apiposture', 'API security posture', SettingId == 'agentlessserverlessposture', 'Serverless protection', SettingId == 'serverlesscontainers', 'Serverless containers', isempty(SettingId), 'Unnamed setting / review', strcat('Additional reported setting: ', tostring(ReportedNames[0])))\r\n| extend ReportedSwitch = case(ReportedRows == 0, 'Not reported', EnabledRows > 0 and DisabledRows > 0, 'Conflicting / review', UnknownRows > 0, 'Unknown / review', EnabledRows == ReportedRows, 'Enabled', DisabledRows == ReportedRows, 'Disabled', 'Unknown / review')\r\n| extend DefenderCSPM = case(isempty(PlanId), 'Not observed', PricingTier =~ 'Standard', 'Enabled (paid)', PricingTier =~ 'Free', 'Disabled', 'Unknown tier')\r\n| extend Finding = case(isempty(PlanId), 'Plan not observed / verify', not(InventoryComplete), 'Incomplete settings inventory / verify', PricingTier !in~ ('Standard', 'Free'), 'Unknown plan tier / verify', ReportedRows > 1, 'Duplicate setting rows / review', PricingTier =~ 'Free' and ReportedSwitch == 'Enabled', 'Switch enabled; paid plan disabled', PricingTier =~ 'Free', 'Paid plan disabled', ReportedSwitch == 'Enabled', 'Enabled configuration; verify coverage', ReportedSwitch == 'Disabled', 'Disabled; assess workload requirements', 'Setting not established / verify')\r\n| extend Exclusions = case(SettingId != 'agentlessvmscanning', 'Not applicable', array_length(ExclusionValues) == 0, 'Not reported', tostring(ExclusionValues))\r\n| extend AdditionalPropertyNames = iff(array_length(PropertyNames) == 0, 'None reported', tostring(PropertyNames))\r\n| extend WhyReview = case(SettingId == 'agentlessvmscanning', 'Provides machine vulnerability and secret-scanning context. Review exclusion tags and actual scan coverage; Subscription Owner permissions are required for full activation.', SettingId == 'agentlessdiscoveryforkubernetes', 'Provides Kubernetes configuration, identity and network context for security explorer and attack paths. Verify supported cluster coverage.', SettingId == 'containerregistriesvulnerabilityassessments', 'Finds vulnerabilities in supported registry images. Verify registry access, supported images and actual assessment results.', SettingId == 'sensitivedatadiscovery', 'Adds sensitive-data context for risk prioritization. This accesses customer data; review permissions, supported stores and scanning scope.', SettingId == 'entrapermissionsmanagement', 'Identifies excessive and unused permissions. Verify identity data collection and resulting recommendations; collection can take time.', SettingId == 'apiposture', 'Discovers and assesses supported APIs. Review service tier, region and sensitive-data-discovery prerequisites; this is separate from the Defender for APIs paid workload plan.', SettingId == 'agentlessserverlessposture', 'Assesses supported Web Apps and Functions. Review workload eligibility and billable-resource impact before enabling.', SettingId == 'serverlesscontainers', 'Adds posture for supported Container Apps and Container Instances. Review Registry access separately for full features, cloud availability and charges.', 'Review this reported extension in Defender CSPM Settings; no purpose or coverage is inferred from an unknown API name.')\r\n| extend NextStep = case(isempty(PlanId) or not(InventoryComplete) or ReportedSwitch !in ('Enabled', 'Disabled'), 'Verify read access and the reported plan settings; missing or invalid values are not Disabled.', PricingTier =~ 'Free', 'Decide whether Defender CSPM is needed before enabling paid features; a saved extension switch does not enable its parent plan.', PricingTier !~ 'Standard', 'Establish the plan tier before interpreting feature availability.', ReportedSwitch == 'Disabled', 'If needed for supported workloads, enable this component in Environment settings > subscription > Defender plans > Defender CSPM > Settings, then Continue and Save.', 'Verify actual coverage, permissions and exclusions; do not treat an enabled switch as a protection or compliance pass.')\r\n| extend Documentation = case(SettingId == 'agentlessvmscanning', 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/enable-agentless-scanning-vms', SettingId == 'agentlessdiscoveryforkubernetes' or SettingId == 'containerregistriesvulnerabilityassessments', 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/how-to-enable-agentless-containers', SettingId == 'sensitivedatadiscovery', 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/concept-data-security-posture-prepare', SettingId == 'entrapermissionsmanagement', 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/permissions-management', SettingId == 'apiposture', 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/enable-api-security-posture', SettingId == 'agentlessserverlessposture', 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/serverless-protection', SettingId == 'serverlesscontainers', 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/posture-for-serverless-containers', 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/tutorial-enable-cspm-plan#enable-the-components-of-the-defender-cspm-plan')\r\n| extend ReportedSetting = iff(isempty(SettingId), 'Name not reported', tostring(ReportedNames[0]))\r\n| project Subscription, SubscriptionResourceId, subscriptionId, Feature, ReportedSwitch, DefenderCSPM, Finding, ReportedSetting, Exclusions, AdditionalPropertyNames, WhyReview, NextStep, Documentation\r\n| order by Subscription asc, Feature asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "CSPM feature settings - reported switch, parent plan and required review",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "noDataMessage": "No selected subscriptions were returned. Check the subscription selection and Reader permissions.",
              "noDataMessageStyle": 2,
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "exportToExcelOptions": "all",
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true,
                "rowLimit": 10000,
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "subscriptionId",
                    "formatter": 5
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "SubscriptionResourceId",
