                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 4. History and workspace data\nChoose one destination workspace and select **Run check** to query up to 90 days of evidence. **Setup tips does not run this check**: history remains opt-in because Log Analytics queries can incur costs. Delivery evidence examines all standards for the selected source subscriptions; snapshot panels have a separate **History standard** selector.\n\nA missing table or insufficient workspace access stays a query error, not a pass. Missing rows can reflect export timing, retention, access or an unmatched source scope. Snapshots are weekly; allow at least one week for the first snapshot and additional time to build history. Streaming occurs on change and is used only as delivery evidence, not mixed into snapshot charts."
            },
            "name": "ReadinessHistoryGuidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "#### Setup instructions — workspace history\n1. Verify **workspace read/query access**, the **SecurityRegulatoryCompliance** table, data retention and expected ingestion/retention costs. Configuration alone does not establish data delivery.\n2. Choose the destination in **History workspace**, then set **Query history** to **Run check**. Review each source subscription's evidence before interpreting snapshot posture or trends. No rows or query errors are not a pass.\n3. Use **Open Compliance Over Time** below to open Microsoft's published template, then choose the workspace in that workbook. Alternatively, open the built-in workbook from the [Defender for Cloud workbooks gallery](https://portal.azure.com/#view/Microsoft_Azure_Security/SecurityMenuBlade/~/28) (commercial Azure). In other clouds, open **Defender for Cloud > Workbooks** in that cloud's portal.\n\nMicrosoft Learn: [Workspace access](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/logs/manage-access) · [Data retention](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/logs/data-retention-configure) · [Compliance Over Time workbook guidance](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/custom-dashboards-azure-workbooks#compliance-over-time-workbook)."
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "ShowSetupTips",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "On"
            },
            "name": "ReadinessHistorySetupTips"
          },
          {
            "type": 11,
            "content": {
              "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
              "style": "nav",
              "links": [
                {
                  "linkTarget": "WorkbookTemplate",
                  "linkLabel": "Open Compliance Over Time",
                  "style": "secondary",
                  "workbookContext": {
                    "componentIdSource": "static",
                    "componentId": "Azure Monitor",
                    "resourceIdsSource": "workbook",
                    "templateIdSource": "static",
                    "templateId": "Community-Workbooks/Azure Security Center/Compliance",
                    "typeSource": "default",
                    "gallerySource": "default",
                    "locationSource": "default",
                    "passSpecificParams": true,
                    "templateParameters": []
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "name": "OpenComplianceOverTime"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "13837811-3f21-4119-bd8a-f8bd000e377d",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "HistoryWorkspace",
                  "label": "History workspace",
                  "type": 5,
                  "description": "Choose an accessible Log Analytics destination; it can be in another subscription.",
                  "isRequired": false,
                  "multiSelect": false,
                  "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces'\r\n| project id",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "value::all"
                  ],
                  "value": "",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "resourceTypeFilter": {
                      "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces": true
                    },
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "queryType": 1,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
                },
                {
                  "id": "4f29710a-75bf-4f4b-9ae7-34858e91011c",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "CheckHistory",
                  "label": "Query history",
                  "type": 2,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "value": "Off",
                  "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"Off\",\"label\":\"Not checked\"},{\"value\":\"On\",\"label\":\"Run check\"}]"
                }
              ],
              "style": "pills"
            },
            "name": "ReadinessHistoryParameters"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let RecordedHistory = SecurityRegulatoryCompliance\r\n| where TimeGenerated >= ago(90d)\r\n| summarize SnapshotRecords = countif(IsSnapshot == true), FirstSnapshot = minif(TimeGenerated, IsSnapshot == true), LatestSnapshot = maxif(TimeGenerated, IsSnapshot == true), StreamingRecords = countif(IsSnapshot == false), LatestStreaming = maxif(TimeGenerated, IsSnapshot == false), UnknownFrequencyRecords = countif(isnull(IsSnapshot)), IncompleteSnapshotRecords = countif(IsSnapshot == true and (isempty(ComplianceStandard) or isempty(ComplianceControl) or isempty(RecommendationId))) by SourceSubscription = tolower(tostring(RegulatoryComplianceSubscriptionId)), WorkspaceId = tostring(TenantId);\r\ndatatable(SourceSubscription:string)[{Subscription:subid}]\r\n| extend SourceSubscription = tolower(SourceSubscription)\r\n| join kind=leftouter (RecordedHistory) on SourceSubscription\r\n| extend SnapshotRecords = coalesce(SnapshotRecords, 0), StreamingRecords = coalesce(StreamingRecords, 0), UnknownFrequencyRecords = coalesce(UnknownFrequencyRecords, 0), IncompleteSnapshotRecords = coalesce(IncompleteSnapshotRecords, 0)\r\n| extend SnapshotObservation = case(SnapshotRecords == 0, 'No snapshot observed in 90 days', LatestSnapshot < ago(8d), 'No snapshot in the last 8 days', LatestSnapshot - FirstSnapshot < 6d, 'Recent snapshot; history still limited', 'Snapshot records span at least 6 days')\r\n| extend StreamingObservation = iff(StreamingRecords > 0, 'Stream records observed', 'None observed; changes trigger streaming')\r\n| extend Recommendation = case(SnapshotRecords == 0, 'Check the destination, permissions and retention; a first weekly snapshot may still be pending.', LatestSnapshot < ago(8d), 'Review export delivery, workspace access and retention; no recent weekly snapshot was observed.', LatestSnapshot - FirstSnapshot < 6d, 'Wait for additional weekly snapshots before relying on a trend.', 'Open Compliance Over Time and review the observed history, access and retention.')\r\n| extend WorkspaceId = iff(isempty(WorkspaceId), 'Not observed', WorkspaceId)\r\n| extend SubscriptionResource = iff(SourceSubscription matches regex '(?i)^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$', strcat('/subscriptions/', SourceSubscription), '')\r\n| project SourceSubscription, SubscriptionResource, WorkspaceId, SnapshotObservation, FirstSnapshot, LatestSnapshot, SnapshotRecords, StreamingObservation, LatestStreaming, StreamingRecords, UnknownFrequencyRecords, IncompleteSnapshotRecords, Recommendation\r\n| order by LatestSnapshot desc, SourceSubscription asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "History delivery evidence (all standards)",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 7776000000
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{HistoryWorkspace}"
              ],
              "noDataMessage": "No selected source subscriptions or history were returned. Check the selection, destination, table and permissions.",
              "noDataMessageStyle": 2,
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "exportToExcelOptions": "all",
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true,
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "SourceSubscription",
                    "label": "Source subscription ID"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "WorkspaceId",
                    "label": "Log Analytics workspace ID"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "UnknownFrequencyRecords",
                    "label": "Unknown-frequency records"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "IncompleteSnapshotRecords",
                    "label": "Snapshot records with incomplete identifiers"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "SubscriptionResource",
                    "label": "Open source subscription"
                  }
                ],
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "SubscriptionResource",
                    "formatter": 13,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "Resource",
                      "showIcon": true,
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "30ch",
                      "aggregation": "None"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "CheckHistory",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "On"
            },
            "name": "ReadinessHistory"
          },
          {
            "type": 12,
            "content": {
              "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
              "groupType": "editable",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": 9,
                  "content": {
                    "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                    "parameters": [
                      {
                        "id": "145c0200-f1ee-457d-9888-aac6abe57ee0",
                        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                        "name": "HistoryStandard",
                        "label": "History standard",
                        "type": 2,
                        "isRequired": true,
                        "query": "let SelectedSubscriptions = datatable(SourceSubscription:string)[{Subscription:subid}]\r\n| extend SourceSubscription = tolower(SourceSubscription);\r\nlet HistoryRows = SecurityRegulatoryCompliance\r\n| where TimeGenerated >= ago(90d)\r\n| extend SourceSubscription = tolower(tostring(RegulatoryComplianceSubscriptionId)), Standard = tostring(ComplianceStandard), ControlId = tostring(ComplianceControl)\r\n| join kind=inner (SelectedSubscriptions) on SourceSubscription\r\n;\r\nHistoryRows\r\n| where IsSnapshot == true and isnotempty(Standard)\r\n| distinct value = Standard, label = Standard\r\n| order by label asc",
                        "queryType": 0,
                        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                        "crossComponentResources": [
                          "{HistoryWorkspace}"
                        ],
                        "defaultValue": "value::all",
                        "value": "value::all",
                        "typeSettings": {
                          "additionalResourceOptions": [
                            "value::all"
                          ],
                          "selectAllValue": "*",
                          "showDefault": false
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "style": "pills"
                  },
                  "name": "HistoryStandardParameters"
                },
                {
                  "type": 1,
                  "content": {
                    "json": "### Observed snapshot posture and changes\nEach result stays within one **source subscription and standard**; there is no cross-standard compliance score. Records are grouped by UTC snapshot day and deduplicated by control, recommendation and assessed resource, using the latest assessment record. Failed evidence wins; unknown evidence is not passed. A control is assessed only when its resulting state is Passed or Failed. **Pass % = passed / (passed + failed)**; other states are reported separately. Missing identifiers suppress affected percentages instead of manufacturing a pass.\n\nThe comparison is against the **previous observed snapshot day**, not necessarily seven days earlier. **Change (pp)** uses only controls assessed in both snapshots; read **Matched controls** and the actual dates. Newly observed and no-longer-observed controls appear separately below, not as remediation. The weekly charts use the latest observed day in each UTC week, without carrying records into missing weeks. Rates can change with assessment coverage, so inspect the companion count chart. Charts show observed weekly points only. Missing weeks and unusable rates are omitted, not plotted as zero or connected by lines; chart timestamps may display in your local time zone. Narrow the source subscriptions or history standard for readable series; native chart/result limits still apply.\n\nSnapshot history is separate from the current ARG Overview and can lag it. [Microsoft's Compliance Over Time template](https://github.com/microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/Workbooks/Azure%20Security%20Center/Compliance/Compliance.workbook) is the reference for this view; these panels intentionally keep unknown states and subscription boundaries explicit."
                  },
                  "name": "HistorySnapshotGuidance"
                },
                {
                  "type": 3,
                  "content": {
                    "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
                    "query": "let SelectedSubscriptions = datatable(SourceSubscription:string)[{Subscription:subid}]\r\n| extend SourceSubscription = tolower(SourceSubscription);\r\nlet HistoryRows = SecurityRegulatoryCompliance\r\n| where TimeGenerated >= ago(90d)\r\n| extend SourceSubscription = tolower(tostring(RegulatoryComplianceSubscriptionId)), Standard = tostring(ComplianceStandard), ControlId = tostring(ComplianceControl)\r\n| join kind=inner (SelectedSubscriptions) on SourceSubscription\r\n\r\n| where \"{HistoryStandard:escapejson}\" == '*' or Standard == \"{HistoryStandard:escapejson}\"\r\n| extend SnapshotDay = startofday(TimeGenerated);\r\nlet SnapshotRows = HistoryRows\r\n| where IsSnapshot == true and isnotempty(Standard);\r\nlet SnapshotDays = SnapshotRows\r\n| summarize LastRecord = max(TimeGenerated), IncompleteRecords = countif(isempty(ControlId) or isempty(RecommendationId)) by SourceSubscription, Standard, SnapshotDay;\r\nlet ControlDays = SnapshotRows\r\n| where isnotempty(ControlId)\r\n| extend StateRank = case(State =~ 'Failed', 6, isempty(RecommendationId), 5, State =~ 'Passed', 4, State =~ 'Skipped', 3, State =~ 'NotApplicable' or State =~ 'Not applicable', 2, State =~ 'Unsupported', 1, 5)\r\n| summarize StateRank = max(StateRank) by SourceSubscription, Standard, SnapshotDay, ControlId, RecommendationId, AssessedResourceId, TimeGenerated\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, StateRank) by SourceSubscription, Standard, SnapshotDay, ControlId, RecommendationId, AssessedResourceId\r\n| summarize StateRank = max(StateRank) by SourceSubscription, Standard, SnapshotDay, ControlId\r\n| extend ControlState = case(StateRank == 6, 'Failed', StateRank == 5, 'Unknown', StateRank == 4, 'Passed', StateRank == 3, 'Skipped', StateRank == 2, 'Not applicable', 'Unsupported');\r\nlet DayPosture = SnapshotDays\r\n| join kind=leftouter (\r\n    ControlDays\r\n    | summarize Passed = countif(ControlState == 'Passed'), Failed = countif(ControlState == 'Failed'), Other = countif(ControlState !in ('Passed', 'Failed')) by SourceSubscription, Standard, SnapshotDay\r\n) on SourceSubscription, Standard, SnapshotDay\r\n| extend Passed = coalesce(Passed, 0), Failed = coalesce(Failed, 0), Other = coalesce(Other, 0)\r\n| extend Assessed = Passed + Failed\r\n| extend PassPercent = iff(Assessed > 0 and IncompleteRecords == 0, 100.0 * Passed / Assessed, real(null));\r\nlet LatestDays = SnapshotDays\r\n| summarize LatestDay = max(SnapshotDay) by SourceSubscription, Standard;\r\nlet PairDays = SnapshotDays\r\n| join kind=inner (LatestDays) on SourceSubscription, Standard\r\n| summarize LatestDay = max(LatestDay), PreviousDay = maxif(SnapshotDay, SnapshotDay < LatestDay), ObservedDays = count() by SourceSubscription, Standard;\r\nlet CurrentControls = ControlDays\r\n| join kind=inner (PairDays | where isnotnull(PreviousDay)) on SourceSubscription, Standard\r\n| where SnapshotDay == LatestDay\r\n| project SourceSubscription, Standard, ControlId, CurrentState = ControlState;\r\nlet PreviousControls = ControlDays\r\n| join kind=inner (PairDays | where isnotnull(PreviousDay)) on SourceSubscription, Standard\r\n| where SnapshotDay == PreviousDay\r\n| project PreviousSubscription = SourceSubscription, PreviousStandard = Standard, PreviousControl = ControlId, PreviousState = ControlState;\r\nlet ControlComparison = CurrentControls\r\n| join kind=fullouter (PreviousControls) on $left.SourceSubscription == $right.PreviousSubscription, $left.Standard == $right.PreviousStandard, $left.ControlId == $right.PreviousControl\r\n| extend SourceSubscription = coalesce(SourceSubscription, PreviousSubscription), Standard = coalesce(Standard, PreviousStandard), ControlId = coalesce(ControlId, PreviousControl)\r\n| extend Comparable = CurrentState in ('Passed', 'Failed') and PreviousState in ('Passed', 'Failed')\r\n| extend Change = case(isempty(CurrentState), 'Not observed in latest snapshot', isempty(PreviousState), 'Newly observed control', CurrentState == PreviousState, 'Unchanged', CurrentState == 'Failed', 'Became failed', PreviousState == 'Failed' and CurrentState == 'Passed', 'Recovered to passed', 'Other state change');\r\nlet ComparisonCounts = ControlComparison\r\n| summarize MatchedControls = countif(Comparable), PassedDifference = sum(iff(Comparable, iff(CurrentState == 'Passed', 1, 0) - iff(PreviousState == 'Passed', 1, 0), 0)) by SourceSubscription, Standard;\r\nlet PriorQuality = DayPosture\r\n| project SourceSubscription, Standard, PreviousDay = SnapshotDay, PreviousIncomplete = IncompleteRecords;\r\nDayPosture\r\n| join kind=inner (PairDays) on SourceSubscription, Standard\r\n| where SnapshotDay == LatestDay\r\n| join kind=leftouter (PriorQuality) on SourceSubscription, Standard, PreviousDay\r\n| join kind=leftouter (ComparisonCounts) on SourceSubscription, Standard\r\n| extend MatchedControls = coalesce(MatchedControls, 0)\r\n| extend ChangePp = iff(MatchedControls > 0 and IncompleteRecords == 0 and PreviousIncomplete == 0, 100.0 * PassedDifference / MatchedControls, real(null))\r\n| extend Observation = case(IncompleteRecords > 0, 'Incomplete identifiers; results partial', LastRecord < ago(8d), 'Stale snapshot; review delivery', ObservedDays < 2, 'First observed snapshot day; no comparison', MatchedControls == 0, 'No common assessed controls', PreviousIncomplete > 0, 'Previous snapshot identifiers incomplete', 'Observed snapshots; completeness not established')\r\n| extend SubscriptionResource = iff(SourceSubscription matches regex '(?i)^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$', strcat('/subscriptions/', SourceSubscription), '')\r\n| project SourceSubscription, SubscriptionResource, Standard, Passed, Failed, Other, PassPercent = round(PassPercent, 1), ChangePp = round(ChangePp, 1), MatchedControls, PreviousDay = format_datetime(PreviousDay, 'yyyy-MM-dd'), LatestDay = format_datetime(LatestDay, 'yyyy-MM-dd'), Observation\r\n| order by Failed desc, Standard asc, SourceSubscription asc",
